All unit tests pass. Now Phase 4b: E2E tests. Let me add the scenarios to `tests/e2e/freecell.spec.js`.

First, I need a helper in helpers.js for solverCacheInfo. The plan says to use test API. Let me add:

```js
/** 解法キャッシュの状態({ active, remainingMoves })を取得する */
export function solverCacheInfo(page) {
